++  test-arith-errors
  ::  BadArgPlus: the pin's message names the Java method signature; normalized (C1.2)
  %+  expect-eq
    !>  ^-  (list tape)
    :~  "BadArgLt ! EC2266 The second argument of < should be an integer, but instead it is: \"a\""
        "DivZero ! EC2179 The second argument of \\div is 0."
        "ExptOverflow ! EC2178 Overflow when computing 2^31"
        "ModNegDivisor ! EC2169 The second argument of % should be a positive number, but instead it is: -2"
        "ModZero ! EC2169 The second argument of % should be a positive number, but instead it is: 0"
        "OverflowMinus ! EC2178 Overflow when computing -2147483647-2"
        "OverflowPlus ! EC2178 Overflow when computing 2147483647+1"
        "OverflowTimes ! EC2178 Overflow when computing 100000*100000"
    ==
  !>
  %^  project-defs:check  '---- MODULE A ----\0aEXTENDS Integers\0aDivZero == 5 \\div 0\0aModZero == 5 % 0\0aModNegDivisor == 5 % (-2)\0aOverflowPlus == 2147483647 + 1\0aOverflowMinus == (-2147483647) - 2\0aOverflowTimes == 100000 * 100000\0aExptOverflow == 2 ^ 31\0aBadArgPlus == 1 + "a"\0aBadArgLt == 1 < "a"\0a====\0a'  'CONSTANT Unused = 0\0a'
  ~['BadArgPlus']
